    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/862fbda6cbf6057e22b75be490dd6561.poster.avif?t=1750135226\" width=387 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/862fbda6cbf6057e22b75be490dd6561.webm?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/60248ed14155e47e82366194ed07a34c.poster.avif?t=1750135226\" width=620 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/60248ed14155e47e82366194ed07a34c.webm?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/60248ed14155e47e82366194ed07a34c.mp4?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TOLOM is an open-world roguelike deckbuilder with turn-based combat. You play as Tolom, a wandering soul hiding inside a small bell, trying to escape the grasp of a dark presence threatening to consume everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/dbe6d780dc377cd306a80b181fd9adb2.poster.avif?t=1750135226\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/dbe6d780dc377cd306a80b181fd9adb2.webm?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/dbe6d780dc377cd306a80b181fd9adb2.mp4?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a suit at the start of your journey\u2014each one defines a unique playstyle and offers a different way to approach combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/cc87a21faac1d51de2fec9f040fa5e53.poster.avif?t=1750135226\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/cc87a21faac1d51de2fec9f040fa5e53.webm?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/cc87a21faac1d51de2fec9f040fa5e53.mp4?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight using consumable cards: each one is spent when played, so every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/2e4b854935b036eaf56ad38038e8e988.poster.avif?t=1750135226\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/2e4b854935b036eaf56ad38038e8e988.webm?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/2e4b854935b036eaf56ad38038e8e988.mp4?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore open maps with complete freedom. Decide what to face, when to buy new cards, and when to confront the final challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/7a91ecdddda1cc8175bbc5a25feaf625.poster.avif?t=1750135226\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/7a91ecdddda1cc8175bbc5a25feaf625.webm?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/7a91ecdddda1cc8175bbc5a25feaf625.mp4?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling doesn\u2019t mean giving up\u2014try again with a new strategy and uncover what lies beyond the miasma.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckbuilding with fully consumable cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic and challenging turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suits that define your playstyle from the beginning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open exploration and non-linear progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability with meaningful choices and varied paths</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/862fbda6cbf6057e22b75be490dd6561.poster.avif?t=1750135226\" width=387 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/862fbda6cbf6057e22b75be490dd6561.webm?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/60248ed14155e47e82366194ed07a34c.poster.avif?t=1750135226\" width=620 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/60248ed14155e47e82366194ed07a34c.webm?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/60248ed14155e47e82366194ed07a34c.mp4?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TOLOM is an open-world roguelike deckbuilder with turn-based combat. You play as Tolom, a wandering soul hiding inside a small bell, trying to escape the grasp of a dark presence threatening to consume everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/dbe6d780dc377cd306a80b181fd9adb2.poster.avif?t=1750135226\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/dbe6d780dc377cd306a80b181fd9adb2.webm?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/dbe6d780dc377cd306a80b181fd9adb2.mp4?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a suit at the start of your journey\u2014each one defines a unique playstyle and offers a different way to approach combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/cc87a21faac1d51de2fec9f040fa5e53.poster.avif?t=1750135226\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/cc87a21faac1d51de2fec9f040fa5e53.webm?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/cc87a21faac1d51de2fec9f040fa5e53.mp4?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight using consumable cards: each one is spent when played, so every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/2e4b854935b036eaf56ad38038e8e988.poster.avif?t=1750135226\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/2e4b854935b036eaf56ad38038e8e988.webm?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/2e4b854935b036eaf56ad38038e8e988.mp4?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore open maps with complete freedom. Decide what to face, when to buy new cards, and when to confront the final challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/7a91ecdddda1cc8175bbc5a25feaf625.poster.avif?t=1750135226\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/7a91ecdddda1cc8175bbc5a25feaf625.webm?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/7a91ecdddda1cc8175bbc5a25feaf625.mp4?t=1750135226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling doesn\u2019t mean giving up\u2014try again with a new strategy and uncover what lies beyond the miasma.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckbuilding with fully consumable cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic and challenging turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suits that define your playstyle from the beginning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open exploration and non-linear progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability with meaningful choices and varied paths</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "TOLOM is an open-world deckbuilding roguelike with turn-based combat. Equip suits that change your playstyle, fight with consumable cards, and explore at your own pace. Choose your battles, find upgrades, and decide when to face the final challenge. If you fall, come back with a new strategy.",
